  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid off the upgraded hand: more middle cards can stop a suit and low [♠]s become real trumps, so bids of 8 or more become reachable, while nil gets much harder.",
    "opponent": "Hidden until it changes who wins a trick; after that your team's middling cards keep beating theirs.",
    "rationale": "Upgrades filtered to low cards have measured best among enablers; this one never wastes the raise on honors already near [A] (unlike seed-raise), and any build that bids would buy it.",
